      "attributes": [
        {
          "doc_text": " A helper trait that is used to enforce that the `ClosureKind` of a goal",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            4542,
            4617
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " is within the capabilities of a `CoroutineClosure`, and which allows us",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            4622,
            4697
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " to delay the projection of the tupled upvar types until after upvar",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            4702,
            4773
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " analysis is complete.",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            4778,
            4803
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            4808,
            4811
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " The `Self` type is expected to be the `kind_ty` of the coroutine-closure,",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            4816,
            4893
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " and thus either `?0` or `i8`/`i16`/`i32` (see docs for `ClosureKind`",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            4898,
            4970
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " for an explanation of that). The `GoalKind` is also the same type, but",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            4975,
            5049
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " representing the kind of the trait that the closure is being called with.",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            5054,
            5131
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": null,
